WEBVTT

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:02.850
MR: And what was it in 2018
that kind of prompted you?

00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:06.312
VN: I remember speaking
to one of my uncles, Charles,

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:10.316
and asking him if he has seen any changes

00:01:10.316 --> 00:01:13.444
from when he was much younger
and right now.

00:01:13.486 --> 00:01:19.742
And he explained to me
that 20 years ago in a specific place,

00:01:19.742 --> 00:01:21.661
he mentioned in Mitanya

00:01:21.702 --> 00:01:25.206
that they would expect rains
at a specific time.

00:01:25.248 --> 00:01:28.417
But then he said now, 20 years later,

00:01:28.459 --> 00:01:33.256
that the farmers cannot tell
when the rains would come.